## Final Outcome

**Status:** 🔄 Transferred

**Reason:** Customer indicated that they already have an existing loan.

**Next Step:** The request is routed to the **Loan Transfer Specialist**, who will contact the customer directly.

### Important Flow Rule

Once an existing loan or EMI-reduction requirement is detected, the assistant **does not continue with the remaining eligibility questions**.

```text
Customer Verification
        ↓
LAP Offer Presented
        ↓
Existing Loan Check
        ↓
Existing Loan = YES
        ↓
Loan Transfer Specialist
        ↓
      END CALL
```

> **Note:** This conversation demonstrates the existing-loan transfer scenario in the LAP qualification workflow.
